    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_0",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "by Author\nRevansizam nije pravi termin,mada caciji to zasluzuju,dovoljna je kazna od strane gradjana i studenata i kada smenom ove kriminogene satanisticke sekte,na vlast budu postavljeni,neokaljani tuzioci i sudije,po \"zasluzi\",od vrha piramide,pa sve do odbornika opstinskih,kazniti filigramskom preciznoscu...\nSvi gradjani da budu upoznati o svim njihovim nedelima i to poimence...nikako inicijalima,sve pratimo i necemo nasesti lukavostima...",
      "author": "Stevan Jovanovic a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_1",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "Nema vise nazad, sad mora do kraja",
      "author": "Ljuban Brakus a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_2",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "Ma treba kosti lomuti,a ne samo tući.govna ustaška,šta ste umisluli.jebo vas picula u usta.pazi da se neokrene samo,jel ćemo vas juriti po srbiji,zapamti to.",
      "author": "Žika Zeković a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_3",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "Pa da oteraju strah medju ljude ali neće dugo gotovi su",
      "author": "Darko Savic a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_4",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "Nemozes i neces dici ruku na moga sina koji radi svoj posao.Ako je tebi placeno da srusis svoju kucu rusi svome tati apolicija nek radi svoj posao.Samo nerade ko Nemci i Francuzi.",
      "author": "Radmila Lovrić a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_5",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "To bi vi da rusite matletirate a kao deca mrs bre u tri lepe treba strozniji zakon ko stetu napravi da je plati a ko baci na policiju kamenice od tri do pet godina popravnog rada",
      "author": "Vasilije Bakovic",
      "created_at": "17 hours ago",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_6",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "Nisu ta vaša deca još osetila pravu policijsku reakciju\nNa zapad ih pošaljite da blokiraju i da. vidite tek šta znaci policija",
      "author": "Svetlana Jovic a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_7",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "botovi predstavljaju noćnu moru - ali najtamnija je noć pred zoru",
      "author": "Dragan Kezunović a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl_8",
      "source": "facebook",
      "post_url": "https://www.facebook.com/rezimdarobija/posts/pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "post_id": "pfbid0hUCWXJfFQj7UYCsJqazwBMqcDZzM8LFGA7LwSEFHfzfnwfEAEqNWgDEgKNsmqSkvl",
      "text": "Dobro je da nisu dobili orden i unapređenje",
      "author": "Srđan Alic a day ago",
      "created_at": "",
      "is_reply": false,
      "parent_comment_id": null
    },
    {
